
>> Animal := Chinthu chatsopano.
Animal chikafika: ['chatsopano'] chitani: { <- wekha chatsopano init.
}.

Animal chikafika: ['init'] chitani: {
	zake sound := ['?'].
	zake legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal chatsopano.
Dog chikafika: ['init'] chitani: {
	wekha init.
	zake sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal chikafika: ['malemba-a-mawu'] chitani: { <- zake legs malemba-a-mawu + zake sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog chatsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: poodle, mzere-watsopano.

